 "_design": "Overlord jab 1, rebuilt from zero (ANIM-JAB-1, 2026-11-11) from the owner's idea of 2026-11-08 and his reference video: a contemptuous backhand slap with the right hand (Ganondorf, Ocarina of Time), the left forearm folded flat on the belly. Startup f0-5: from the upright idle the trunk coils left and the right hand goes to the left shoulder, elbow aimed at the target (f4). The slap travels f4->f6 and lands on the first active frame (active f6-8); the arm then only drifts (no pop after a hitbox frame) and holds to f13. FAF f22, idle at f28. Feet planted. Separate asset from jab 2; the jab-2 cancel leaves from the f6-f13 hold.",
